"\n"
"The definition of §4 is \"there exists a number §5\n"
"such that §6. \" So we're going to have to learn\n"
"how to prove \"exists\" statements, and how to use \"exists\" hypotheses."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `∃`
#: Game.Levels.LessOrEqual.L05_ExistsHyp
msgid "§0 Hypotheses"
msgstr ""

#. §0: `mul_succ`
#. §1: `succ_mul`
