#: Game.Levels.InductionJoined.L03_ZeroOrNot
msgid "## Summary\n"
"\n"
"If §0 is a number, then dragging §1 onto §2 will break the goal into two goals,\n"
"one with §3 and the other with §4.\n"
"\n"
"If §5 is a proof (for example a hypothesis), then dragging §6 onto §7 will break\n"
"the proof up into the pieces used to prove it.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If §8 is a number, then dragging §9 onto §10 will break the goal into two goals,\n"
"one with §11 replaced by 0 and the other with §12 replaced by §13. This\n"
"corresponds to the mathematical idea that every natural number is either §14\n"
"or a successor.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If §15 is a hypothesis, then dragging §16 onto §17 will create a new number §18\n"
"and a proof §19. This is because the *definition* of §20 is\n"
"§21."
msgstr ""

